      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "1. Test case for API endpoint `/blacklist/add` with valid IPv4 address.\n2. Test case for API endpoint `/blacklist/remove` with an existing IP.\n3. Test case for API endpoint `/blacklist/update` with a new subnet range.\n4. Test case for API endpoint `/blacklist/add` with an invalid IP format (e.g., non-numeric characters).\n5. Test case for API endpoint `/blacklist/remove` with a non-existent IP.\n6. Test case for simultaneous API updates from multiple sources.\n7. Test case for TCP packet arrival when the source IP is on the blacklist.\n8. Test case for UDP packet arrival when the source IP is on the blacklist.\n9. Test case for TCP packet with missing SYN flag in the header.\n10. Test case for UDP packet with an oversized payload exceeding expected limits.\n11. Test case for TCP packet with an invalid checksum field.\n12. Test case for protocol inspection failure when header length is zero.\n13. Test case for CPU load at 10% triggering rule adjustment.\n14. Test case for CPU load at 85% triggering aggressive",
